nt &p_idx)**\r\n```cpp\r\n\tif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\t_check_bind();\r\n\t}\r\n\ton_skeleton_update();\r\n\r\n\tnotify_property_list_changed();\r\n```\r\n? (The latter is not processed when the skeleton is changed, so probably I guess we should select the former.)","created_at":"2025-04-26T06:40:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T09:47:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104209#discussion_r2061195706","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104209","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2061195706"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104209#discussion_r2061195706"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104209"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2061195706/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":146,"original_line":146,"side":"LEFT","in_reply_to_id":2061188640,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]